  "body": "IMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENT, CONTACT US RIGHT AWAY!\r\n\r\nWe are offering a 10% cash discount on 5 selected sections (valid for unconditional contracts signed in June only).\r\nWe offer Builder's Terms for up to 9 months.\r\nOur business partner offers Builder's Terms financing of section purchase up to an 80%.\r\nOur business partner offers Construction Loans up to an 80% .\r\n\r\nOffering a practical and well-located parcel of land, 1 Whenuateitei Crescent presents a 453sqm (approx.) opportunity in the heart of Stanmore Bay. The site features workable proportions and strong long-term appeal, making it well suited to a range of modern residential designs.\r\nEnjoy the relaxed coastal lifestyle with Stanmore Bay Beach just minutes away, ideal for morning walks or time by the water. Local shops, cafés, schools, and recreational facilities are all close by, while the upcoming Penlink connection will further enhance access to SH1 and Auckland's wider motorway network.\r\nA solid opportunity to secure land in a proven coastal location.\r\nReach out today to discuss how this site could work for you.",
